## Chapter two: reading code together

{data-line-numbers=1-4|2|5-7}
```php
foreach ($orders as $order) {
    $customer = $this->Customers->get($order->customer_id);
    $order->customer_name = $customer->name;
}

$orders = $this->Orders->find()
    ->contain(['Customers'])
    ->all();
```

{.note}
:::
One query per row above, one query below. The fence walks the audience through it.
:::

--

### What it costs

|= Rows |= Queries before |= Queries after |
| 50 | 51 | 1 |
| 500 | 501 | 1 |
| 5000 | 5001 | 1 |

